flowchart TD
    Player([👤 Player]) -->|types a guess| UI["Streamlit UI<br/>app.py"]
    CLI(["demo.py<br/>CLI replay"]) -->|scripted guesses| Rules

    UI -->|raw text| Rules["Game rules<br/>logic_utils.py<br/>parse_guess · check_guess · update_score"]
    Secret[("Secret number<br/>session state")] --> Rules
    Rules -->|"Too High / Too Low / Win"| Turns[("Turn history<br/>(guess, outcome) pairs")]

    subgraph Coach["AI Coach agent · coach.py (never sees the secret)"]
        direction TB
        V["1 · VALIDATE<br/>drop bad turns"] --> P["2 · PLAN<br/>narrow possible range,<br/>pick strategy"]
        P --> A["3 · ACT<br/>propose next guess<br/>(binary search)"]
        A --> C{"4 · CHECK<br/>guardrails pass?"}
        C -->|no, up to 2 times| R["5 · REVISE<br/>nearest valid number"]
        R --> C
        C -->|still failing| F["6 · FALLBACK<br/>basic Higher/Lower hint"]
        C -->|yes| S["Confidence score<br/>(2^attempts − 1) / range size"]
    end

    Turns --> V
    S -->|hint + confidence + check results| UI
    F -->|basic hint| UI
    UI -->|shows hint, confidence,<br/>and passed checks| Player

    Coach -. every step .-> Log[("logs/coach.log")]

    subgraph Testing["Testing · checks the AI's results"]
        Pytest["pytest<br/>tests/"]
        Eval["evaluation/evaluate_coach.py<br/>every secret + guardrail scenarios"]
    end
    Pytest -.-> Rules
    Pytest -.-> Coach
    Eval -.-> Coach
    Eval --> Report[("evaluation/results.md")]
    Report --> Dev([👤 Developer reviews results and logs])
    Log --> Dev
